    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781460/extras/2bf4b6c67a5dc93960d5f81d957ddf09.avif?t=1754155864\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span><br><i><strong>Rent a Girl</strong></i> is a visual novel featuring <strong>8+ different endings</strong> based on your choices \u2014 a story about relationships, personal growth, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a shy university student in Tokyo who has always struggled to connect with others. After a humiliating experience exposes your social naivety, you find an unusual service: a <strong>girlfriend rental for social skills development</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a desperate attempt to overcome shyness turns into a journey of self-discovery, where &quot;fake&quot; relationships can reveal real truths about love, friendship, and personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 Engaging Story</strong> \u2014 A deep narrative about overcoming shyness and personal development  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Multiple Heroines</strong> \u2014 Meet five unique girls with distinct routes, cultures, and personalities  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Relationship System</strong> \u2014 Your choices directly impact dialogues, events, and endings  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Achievement System</strong> \u2014 Unlock milestones as you explore different paths  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Multilingual Support</strong> \u2014 Available in 6 languages: English, Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, and Russian  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong> \u2014 Music and sound effects crafted to enrich every scene  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 High Replayability</strong> \u2014 8+ different endings based on your decisions throughout the story  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc96 Meet the Characters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lin Mei</strong> \u2014 Energetic Chinese chef passionate about cooking and optimism  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seo-Yoon Kim</strong> \u2014 Serious and introspective Korean law student with a warm heart beneath her formal exterior  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ana</strong> \u2014 Vibrant and spontaneous Brazilian exchange student who celebrates life in every detail  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rin</strong> \u2014 Japanese manga artist, introspective and creative, with a unique worldview  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katya</strong> \u2014 Elegant Russian communication student, ambitious and passionate about fashion  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haruna</strong> \u2014 The classmate who started your journey \u2014 and perhaps your awakening  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven narratives with complex, well-developed personalities  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance with gradual and realistic emotional development  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories about personal growth, overcoming shyness, and inner strength  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novels with multiple routes, endings, and high replayability  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature themes handled with sensitivity and respect  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiences exploring diverse cultures in a modern setting  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781460/extras/2bf4b6c67a5dc93960d5f81d957ddf09.avif?t=1754155864\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span><br><i><strong>Rent a Girl</strong></i> is a visual novel featuring <strong>8+ different endings</strong> based on your choices \u2014 a story about relationships, personal growth, and self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a shy university student in Tokyo who has always struggled to connect with others. After a humiliating experience exposes your social naivety, you find an unusual service: a <strong>girlfriend rental for social skills development</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a desperate attempt to overcome shyness turns into a journey of self-discovery, where &quot;fake&quot; relationships can reveal real truths about love, friendship, and personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 Engaging Story</strong> \u2014 A deep narrative about overcoming shyness and personal development  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Multiple Heroines</strong> \u2014 Meet five unique girls with distinct routes, cultures, and personalities  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Relationship System</strong> \u2014 Your choices directly impact dialogues, events, and endings  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Achievement System</strong> \u2014 Unlock milestones as you explore different paths  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Multilingual Support</strong> \u2014 Available in 6 languages: English, Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, and 